Cell["\<\
A repeated/shared inferred LHS axis must repeat the binder spelling (`a_ ... \
a_`).
The old binder-then-bare spelling (`a_ ... a`) is native-WL literal syntax, \
not a
pattern reference, and is rejected before lowering.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->261370902],

