Cell["\<\
22e. The fresh fallback is IDENTITY-STABLE: repeated occurrences of one \
un-sanitizable
name share a memoized identity, so an inconsistent repeated axis is rejected \
(not
silently accepted with two distinct keys) and a string key binds its term.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->584832784],

