Cell["\<\
11b. A name repeated within an input shape is within-tensor contraction, \
which Map
(shape-preserving) does not do \[LongDash] rejected.  The output {{a, b}} is \
duplicate-free, so
EinstoffShapes is Satisfiable and the rejection comes from Map itself (the \
distinctAxesQ
guard, backed by Map's shape-preserving drop-check \[LongDash] defense in \
depth), not the
resolver's output-uniqueness check.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->199110722],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
