Cell["\<\
6b. A string-named bracket #b == Slot[\"b\"] binds by *unification* (no
Slot[b_]-binds-vs-Slot[b]-references asymmetry); repeated occurrences across
operands must agree.  a [b], [b] c with both b = 4 is satisfiable.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->389188404],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
